"P2245534104" "You handled that one well, {HeroName}. I'll make sure that all of the evidence gets to the right people. The Rikti nearly destroyed the world, and even the technology they left behind has all kinds of dangerous traps built into it. Greedy people will do anything to get ahead though, even if it means risking their lives and those of their customers. As long as there are heroes like you to stop them, they're going to have a tough time of it."

