// IntroString :
"P3866839319" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>SERAPH came up with some gizmo they want you to test on the Lost.</A> It's called a Genetic Restabilizer, and it should affect the Lost's destabilized gene structure. What do you say, {HeroName}? Ready to take on the Lost in the name of science?"
